j, Malad West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639108945787017788-0404261016181618.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 2 BHK Apartment at DGS Sheetal Dharmaraj, Malad West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639108945789117349-0404261016181618.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Kitchen in 2 BHK Apartment at DGS Sheetal Dharmaraj, Malad West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639108945791435925-0404261016191619.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 2 BHK Apartment at DGS Sheetal Dharmaraj, Malad West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639108945793805976-0404261016191619.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malad West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malad West, Mumbai located at 19.1951, 72.831*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malad West, Mumbai located at 19.1951, 72.831](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.6 Cr**\n\nThis 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom Flats in Malad West, Mumbai offers a comfortable lifestyle with a pool view from the 8th floor of the 22-story DGS Sheetal Dharmaraj project.Priced at 1.6 crore, this semi-furnished 725 square foot home is designed for modern living.You will appreciate the convenience of 24x7 water supply and a lift, along with a dedicated parking space for one\n\n![Ankita Kudtarkar  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/919820805373638225166158013432.jpg?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n\nPersonalized home recommendations based on your lifestyle, location, and budget.\n\n![Smarter home match recommendation preview](/assets/images/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n![Personalized home matching](/assets/images/recommandation-images/icon-star.svg)\n\nRecommendations tailored to your real needs.\n\n![Smarter locality suggestions](/assets/images/recommandation-images/pin-icon.svg)\n\nDiscover neighborhoods that fit your lifestyle.\n\n![Budget aware recommendations](/assets/images/recommandation-images/wallet-icon.svg)\n\nFind homes that match your budget.\n\n![Personalized property recommendation cards](/assets/images/recommandation-images/property-img.png)\n![voice search]()![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/abrol-vastu-park-malad-west-mumbai-p41298","title":"Abrol Vastu Park Malad West Mumbai - Reviews, Price, Address, Photos 2","raw_content":"![](https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=267087050525738&ev=PageView&noscript=1)\n![logo](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/logo.svg)\n![logo](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/logo-white.svg)\n\n## Abrol Vastu Park\n\n![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)\n![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) Vastu Park, Evershine Nagar Road, Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)\n![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico)\n![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)\n![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg)\n\n###### 3.24 Cr to 3.66 Cr\\*\n\n![Abrol Vastu Park](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/41298/Abrol_Vastu_Park_elevation_1.gif \"Abrol Vastu Park\")\n\n# Abrol Vastu Park in Malad West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Master Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-master-plan.jpg \"Master Plan\")\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n![Abrol Vastu Park](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/41298/Abrol_Vastu_Park_elevation_1.gif \"Abrol Vastu Park\")\n![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)\n![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg)\n![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg)\n\n## About\n\n##### Excellent\n\nA beautiful home that offers perfect comfort to the dwellers and that too in the mid of the megacity is a rare combination. However, at **Abrol Vastu Park**, a venture by Abrol Builders one can find such property that fits budget as well as the expectation of the dwellers. It is good for personal use as well as long-term investment. It has ready to move 2 and 3 BHK flats which are built by expert real estate developers. The project is constructed at Malad East in Mumbai city.\n\nA beautiful home that offers perfect comfort to the dwellers and that too in the mid of the megacity is a rare combination. However, at **Abrol Vastu Park**, a venture by Abrol Builders one can find such property that fits budget as well as the expectation of the dwellers. It is good for personal use as well as long-term investment. It has ready to move 2 and 3 BHK flats which are built by expert real estate developers. The project is constructed at Malad East in Mumbai city.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg)\n![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg)\n![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg)\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg)\n![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg)\n![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg)\n![Waste Disposal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg)\n![Maintenance Staff](https: