nce. CCTV Surveillance.\n\n![Flooring](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor.svg)\n\nVitrified tiles in drawing/dining/bedrooms and kitchen\n\n![Plumbing & Sanitary](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/plumber.svg)\n\nWhite sanitary wares with European WC, CP fittings\n\n![Electrical & Power Backup](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/power_back_up-grey.svg)\n\nCopper wiring in concealed PVC conduits Sufficient light\n\n## Locality Overview of Malad West, Mumbai\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nMalad is home to renowned retail centres including Infinity Mall and Inorbit Mall. Marv Beach and Aksa Beach are only two of the beaches in Malad. The Malad Station is located on the West Line of the Mumbai Suburban Railway. To the north and south, respectively, are Kandivali Station and Goregaon Station. The Western Line railway divides Malad into Malad West and Malad East.\n\n... [Read More](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/malad-west/guide)\n\nMalad is home to renowned retail centres including Infinity Mall and Inorbit Mall. Marv Beach and Aksa Beach are only two of the beaches in Malad. The Malad Station is located on the West Line of the Mumbai Suburban Railway. To the north and south, respectively, are Kandivali Station and Goregaon Station. The Western Line railway divides Malad into Malad West and Malad East.\n\n## Explore Neighbourhoods of abrol vastu park, Malad West\n\n## College\n\n## Hospital\n\n## Police Station\n\n## Properties Price Trend in the Malad West\n\n## Similar Properties to Abrol Vastu Park in Malad West\n\n![Kamanwala Manavsthal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39045/1552562855_Integrated_Arya_Elevatyion.jpg)\n\n##### [Kamanwala Manavsthal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/kamanwala-manavsthal-malad-west-mumbai-p39045)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Location](https://w